    <string name="user_guide_body">Create a playlist, then use Add audio files or Add folder. Tap a song to play. Tap the mini-player to open artwork and lyrics. More → Import lyrics accepts LRC or TXT files up to 2 MB. Drag the round progress thumb to seek. Hold a reorder handle and drag vertically to change order. Selection mode offers batch actions. Recently played removes history only. Album and artist views are classifications. Backup stores playlists, settings, lyrics and images, not original audio or passwords. Android may require renewed folder access after restoring. System media notifications and lock-screen controls work with the background service. OEM capsule display depends on device support.</string>
